Rewrote ``SPEC.md`` to document every file and collection type (dataset, healpix map, lightcone, structure collection, and simulation collection, including nested simulation collections) and the metadata-only signals used to identify each — ``data_type``, ``is_lightcone``, presence of ``/data_linked``, the properties-group check, and the number of distinct header scopes — cross-referencing the four spec names in ``io/specs.py`` and the structural ``group_by_scope`` rule for simulation collections.
